{"metadata":{"slug":[{"Plain":"迹"},0],"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"title":[{"Plain":"迹"},2],"taxon":[{"Plain":"百科. "},3],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>定义</h2>\n<h3>自映射的迹</h3>\n<p>对于"},{"Local":{"url":"对称幺半范畴","text":"对称幺半范畴"}},{"Plain":" $\\mathcal C$ 中"},{"Local":{"url":"可对偶对象","text":"可对偶对象"}},{"Plain":" $X$ 的自映射 $f\\colon X\\to X$, 定义<strong>迹</strong> $\\operatorname{Tr}(f)\\in\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathcal C}(1)$,\n$$\r\n    \\operatorname{Tr}(f):\r\n    1 \\overset{\\operatorname{coev}}{\\to} X\\otimes X^* \\overset{f\\otimes\\mathrm{id}}{\\to} X\\otimes X^*\\overset{\\operatorname{ev}}{\\to} 1.\r\n$$</p>\n<p>对象 $X$ 的恒等映射的迹又叫 $X$ 的"},{"Local":{"url":"幺半维数","text":"幺半维数"}},{"Plain":"\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{dim}X := \\operatorname{Tr}(\\mathrm{id}_X).\r\n$$</p>\n<p>考虑范畴\n$$\r\n\\mathsf{End}_{\\mathcal C} := \\mathsf{Fun}(\\mathbf{B}\\mathbb{N},\\mathcal C)= \\{(X,f)\\colon X\\in\\mathcal C, f\\in\\operatorname{End}_{\\mathcal C}(X)\\},\r\n$$\n(其中 $\\mathbf{B}\\mathbb{N}$ 是 “"},{"Local":{"url":"游走","text":"游走"}},{"Plain":"的自同态”)\n那么迹的构造升级为一个函子\n$$\r\n\\operatorname{Tr}\\colon \\mathsf{End}_\\mathcal C \\to \\operatorname{End}_{\\mathcal C}(1).\r\n$$</p>\n<h3>对象的迹</h3>\n<h2>例</h2>\n<p>当 $\\mathcal C = \\mathsf{Vect}_k$\n时,\n有限维 $k$-线性空间 $V$ 的自映射的迹即是 $\\operatorname{Tr}(f)\\cdot \\mathrm{id}_{k}$.</p>\n"}]}}